finite_seconds(10**400) -> EXC OverflowError int too large to convert to float
Limits(max_runtime_seconds=10**400) -> EXC OverflowError int too large to convert to float
positive_int 10**5000 -> EXC ValueError Exceeds the limit (4300 digits) for integer string conversion; use sys.set_int_max_str_digits() to i
finite_seconds -inf -> EXC ValueError x must be finite (got -inf); NaN/infinity would disable the bound
finite_seconds 5e-324 -> 5e-324
Fraction('٣/٤') -> Fraction(3, 4)
Fraction('1_0/3') -> Fraction(10, 3)
